From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:57:44 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(2d): omit cleared-floor inner ring legs in
 rest_pocket

Clip concentric rest-pocket waterline rings against the cutter reach of
rest material (`plan.rest.offset(r + REST_REACH * 0.5)`), order surviving
pieces interior-out along cut-zone-cleared joins, and re-anchor open
pinched-tip first passes into nearby dive room instead of diving onto
cleared floor and feeding across to the tip. Extract shared pocket pass
emission into `pocket_emit::emit_pocket_passes`.

Fixes #1816
